# Security & Secrets

## Never commit

- `.env` files, API keys, cloud credentials, deploy tokens
- `.cursor/mcp.json` (MCP server tokens)
- `.worktree.env` (parallel worktree port assignments)
- Personal attendee data (PII)

Runtime Cursor files (`.cursor/plan-session.json`, `.cursor/plan-checkpoint.json`, `.cursor/plan-lifecycle.log.jsonl`) and Flutter build artifacts are listed in [`.gitignore`](../../.gitignore).

## CI secrets

- GitHub Actions secrets / variables only — reference by **name**, never paste values into code or docs
- Typical names (optional Fly only): `FLY_API_TOKEN`, repo variable `FLY_APP_NAME`
- Default Pages deploy needs no secrets beyond `GITHUB_TOKEN`

## Demo & local dev

- Demo credentials: fake/sample data only; document in README
- External APIs: use `--dart-define=API_URL=...` locally; document required defines in README
